if heading in old:raise ValueError('Report section already exists')
lines=['',heading,'','All six20-minute scene grants ended and each unit funnel was published separately. The predeclared rule selects'+str(selected)+'degrees:100degrees has'+str(sum(totals[100][k] for k in ('look_flip','look_stay')))+' independently checked Look pairs and60degrees has'+str(sum(totals[60][k] for k in ('look_flip','look_stay')))+'. These are historical construction-policy passes, not supplement13 fixed-label compliance: old T01 review/replay labels can change across views. New fixed-object labels and Flip search are being implemented; no expansion is claimed from these old records.','',
'| FOV | Scene | Recorded attempts | LookFlip | LookStay | Funnel |','|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---|']
