lines+=['','| PBS job | GPUs | Queue seconds | Allocation GPUh | Charge rate | Charged GPUh |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
for a in accounts:lines.append('|'+a['job_id']+'|'+str(a['gpus'])+'|'+str(a['queue_wait_seconds'])+'|'+str(a['allocation_gpu_hours'])+'|'+str(a['charge_rate'])+'|'+str(a['charged_gpu_hours'])+'|')
lines+=['','Two single-GPU allocations used'+str(metrics['total_charged_gpu_hours'])+'charged GPUh in total. Source-level timeout/incomplete status is retained; completed pair evidence was independently checked, not relabeled as a complete pilot. The first60-degree FP203 checkpoint failed a final-controller/preflight association; the strict per-pair Controller adapter then rechecked the same unchanged evidence and accepted6. The original failed record remains.',
'','Flip diagnosis and per-view pool distributions: logs/review/diag_look_flip_existing_01/report.md and logs/runs/diag_look_flip_existing_01.log. Next20-minute pilot uses only the selected FOV, full legal3D-side proposals, edge-view preference, at least onehalf actual Flip attempts and stable object labels. Physical, distance-ratio, prefix, evidence and witness thresholds stay unchanged. Supplement14 permits autonomous iterations; expansion still requires a new independently accepted LookFlip and at least3 accepted Look pairs, within20GPUh.']
